"* SLEW RATE (SR)\n"
"* SMALL SIGNAL OVERSHOOT VS. CAPACITIVE LOAD\n"
"* LARGE SIGNAL RESPONSE\n"
"* OVERLOAD RECOVERY TIME (tor)\n"
"* INPUT BIAS CURRENT (Ib)\n"
"* INPUT OFFSET CURRENT (Ios)\n"
"* INPUT OFFSET VOLTAGE (Vos)\n"
